Under every reading of the 2 open sentences, the conclusion follows: *It is not the case that there is a principal type of Claude such that all of the following hold:
  (a) it is not the case that that principal type of Claude is the same as anthropic;
  (b) both of the following hold:
    (i) it is not the case that that principal type of Claude is the same as operators;
    (ii) it is not the case that that principal type of Claude is the same as users.*
